    "Any app or script that can read your home folder can read these. Move them to the Keychain and your profile looks them up instead, with macOS asking first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any app or script that can read your home folder can read these. Move them to the Keychain and your profile looks them up instead, with macOS asking first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任何能读取个人文件夹的应用或脚本都能读取这些密钥。将它们移到钥匙串，让配置文件改为查询钥匙串，并由 macOS 先询问你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任何能讀取個人檔案夾的應用程式或指令碼都能讀取這些金鑰。將它們移到鑰匙圈，讓配置檔案改為查詢鑰匙圈，並由 macOS 先詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything that reads it from the Keychain stops working until you save it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anything that reads it from the Keychain stops working until you save it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除后，依赖此钥匙串密钥的功能将停止工作，直到你再次保存密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除後，依賴此鑰匙圈金鑰的功能將停止工作，直到你再次儲存金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
