    "Cleared caches go to the Trash first, and Recently cleared puts them back. Folders you always keep are never touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cleared caches go to the Trash first, and Recently cleared puts them back. Folders you always keep are never touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清理缓存时先移到废纸篓，可从“最近清理”放回原处。始终保留的文件夹不会被改动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清理快取時先移到垃圾桶，可從「最近清理」放回原處。始終保留的檔案夾不會被改動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clearing caches" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clearing caches"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在清除缓存"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在清除快取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clearing caches moves them to the Trash first, so Storage can put them back until you empty it. Folders you mark Always Keep are never cleared or suggested." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clearing caches moves them to the Trash first, so Storage can put them back until you empty it. Folders you mark Always Keep are never cleared or suggested."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清理缓存时先移到废纸篓。在清倒废纸篓之前，可从“储存空间”放回原处。标记为“始终保留”的文件夹不会被清理或推荐。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清理快取時先移到垃圾桶。在清倒垃圾桶之前，可從「儲存空間」放回原處。標記為「始終保留」的檔案夾不會被清理或推薦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click for the panel, right-click for every section." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click for the panel, right-click for every section."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按打开面板，右键点按访问所有部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按一下開啟面板，按右鍵訪問所有部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click, then press the new shortcut. Delete clears it, Esc keeps it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
