            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "資料庫重新擁有原生 Mac 應用程式體驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar panel shows one block at a time; their tiles along its bottom switch between them, and ⌘1 to ⌘5 do the same. One block always stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The menu bar panel shows one block at a time; their tiles along its bottom switch between them, and ⌘1 to ⌘5 do the same. One block always stays."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏面板一次显示一个功能块，通过底部按钮或 ⌘1 至 ⌘5 切换。至少保留一个功能块。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選單列面板一次顯示一個功能塊，透過底部按鈕或 ⌘1 至 ⌘5 切換。至少保留一個功能塊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name doesn't match its folder “%@”. Some agents look skills up by folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name doesn't match its folder “%@”. Some agents look skills up by folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名称与文件夹“%@”不一致。部分代理会按文件夹查找 Skill。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名稱與檔案夾「%@」不一致。部分代理會按檔案夾查詢 Skill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same skill in Cursor, Claude, and other folders now appears once, with every source listed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The same skill in Cursor, Claude, and other folders now appears once, with every source listed."
