    "macOS asks before Clove can see your files or type into other apps. Allow what you'll use; you can change any of it later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS asks before Clove can see your files or type into other apps. Allow what you'll use; you can change any of it later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Clove 查看文件或在其他应用中输入前，macOS 会询问你。按需授权，之后随时可以更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Clove 檢視檔案或在其他應用程式中輸入前，macOS 會詢問你。按需授權，之後隨時可以更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks before handing the key to anything but Clove. Choose Allow to be asked every time, or Always Allow to stop asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS asks before handing the key to anything but Clove. Choose Allow to be asked every time, or Always Allow to stop asking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将密钥提供给 Clove 以外的应用前，macOS 会先询问。选择“允许”可每次询问，选择“始终允许”则不再询问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將金鑰提供給 Clove 以外的應用程式前，macOS 會先詢問。選擇「允許」可每次詢問，選擇「始終允許」則不再詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks to quit and reopen Clove. Let it, and setup picks up here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS asks to quit and reopen Clove. Let it, and setup picks up here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 会要求退出并重新打开 Clove。请允许，设置流程会从这里继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 會要求退出並重新開啟 Clove。請允許，設定流程會從這裡繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
